#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:124
msgid "Sensor auto-function rename *(major)*"
msgstr "센서 자동 함수 이름 변경 *(major)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:126
msgid ""
"``sensor.set_whitebal()`` / ``set_gain_ctrl()`` / ``set_exposure_ctrl()`` "
"were renamed to :func:`sensor.set_auto_whitebal` / ``set_auto_gain()`` / "
"``set_auto_exposure()`` (the old names were removed). Each gained an "
"optional ``value=`` keyword to set a manual value instead of auto."
msgstr ""
"``sensor.set_whitebal()`` / ``set_gain_ctrl()`` / ``set_exposure_ctrl()``\\ "
"이 :func:`sensor.set_auto_whitebal` / ``set_auto_gain()`` / "
"``set_auto_exposure()``\\ 로 이름이 변경되었습니다(기존 이름은 제거됨). 각 함수는 자동 대신 수동 값을 설정하기 "
"위한 선택적 ``value=`` 키워드를 추가했습니다."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:131
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `1b22a2961 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/1b22a2961>`__"
msgstr ""
"*커밋:* `1b22a2961 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/1b22a2961>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:136
msgid "Histogram / statistics reworked to object APIs *(major)*"
msgstr "히스토그램 / 통계가 객체 API로 재작업됨 *(major)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:138
msgid ""
"The histogram/statistics surface was reworked into object-based "
"``image.get_histogram()`` / ``get_statistics()`` / ``get_percentile()`` "
"returning histogram/statistics objects. The old flat histogram/statistics "
"results and the ``bin_count`` / ``l_bin_count`` / ``a_bin_count`` / "
"``b_bin_count`` methods were removed (use ``len(histogram.bins())`` etc.)."
msgstr ""
"히스토그램/통계 인터페이스가 히스토그램/통계 객체를 반환하는 객체 기반 ``image.get_histogram()`` / "
"``get_statistics()`` / ``get_percentile()``\\ 로 재작업되었습니다. 기존의 평면적인 히스토그램/통계 "
"결과와 ``bin_count`` / ``l_bin_count`` / ``a_bin_count`` / ``b_bin_count`` 메서드는"
" 제거되었습니다(``len(histogram.bins())`` 등을 사용하세요)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:144
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `011108412 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/011108412>`__, `9f37c83de "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/9f37c83de>`__"
msgstr ""
"*커밋:* `011108412 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/011108412>`__, "
"`9f37c83de <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/9f37c83de>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:150
msgid "``find_features()`` ``scale`` renamed *(major)*"
msgstr "``find_features()``\\ 의 ``scale`` 이름 변경 *(major)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:152
msgid ""
"``image.find_features()`` (Haar) renamed its ``scale=`` keyword to "
"``scale_factor=``. Update ``find_features(cascade, scale=...)`` calls to "
"``scale_factor=...``."
msgstr ""
"``image.find_features()``(Haar)가 ``scale=`` 키워드를 ``scale_factor=``\\ 로 이름 "
"변경했습니다. ``find_features(cascade, scale=...)`` 호출을 ``scale_factor=...``\\ 로 "
"갱신하세요."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:156
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `96e4f770c <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/96e4f770c>`__"
msgstr ""
"*커밋:* `96e4f770c <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/96e4f770c>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:161
msgid "``find_blobs()`` returns objects; ``find_markers()`` removed *(minor)*"
msgstr "``find_blobs()``\\ 가 객체를 반환함; ``find_markers()`` 제거됨 *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:163
msgid ""
"``image.find_blobs()`` now returns blob objects with named accessors (index "
"access still works for backward compatibility), and ``image.find_markers()``"
" was removed — use ``find_blobs(..., merge=True, margin=...)`` instead. The "
"advanced color-blob filter callback is no longer supported."
msgstr ""
"``image.find_blobs()``\\ 가 이제 명명된 접근자를 가진 블롭 객체를 반환하며(하위 호환성을 위해 인덱스 접근도 여전히"
" 동작함), ``image.find_markers()``\\ 는 제거되었습니다 — 대신 ``find_blobs(..., "
"merge=True, margin=...)``\\ 를 사용하세요. 고급 색상 블롭 필터 콜백은 더 이상 지원되지 않습니다."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:168
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `af15ec6eb <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/af15ec6eb>`__"
msgstr ""
"*커밋:* `af15ec6eb <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/af15ec6eb>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:173
msgid "``img.copy_to_fb()`` replaced *(minor)*"
msgstr "``img.copy_to_fb()``\\ 가 교체됨 *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:175
msgid ""
"The ``img.copy_to_fb()`` method was replaced by a ``copy_to_fb=`` keyword on"
" :class:`image.Image` / ``load_image()``. Use ``image.Image(path, "
"copy_to_fb=True)`` to load large images straight into the framebuffer."
msgstr ""
"``img.copy_to_fb()`` 메서드가 :class:`image.Image` / ``load_image()``\\ 의 "
"``copy_to_fb=`` 키워드로 교체되었습니다. 큰 이미지를 프레임버퍼로 바로 로드하려면 ``image.Image(path, "
"copy_to_fb=True)``\\ 를 사용하세요."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:180
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `1645ab94b <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/1645ab94b>`__"
msgstr ""
"*커밋:* `1645ab94b <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/1645ab94b>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:185
msgid "``compress()`` rejects out-of-range quality *(behavior)*"
msgstr "``compress()``\\ 가 범위를 벗어난 품질을 거부함 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:187
msgid ""
"``image.compress()`` / ``compressed()`` now raise an error when ``quality`` "
"is outside 1–100 instead of silently clamping. Clamp ``quality`` into 1–100 "
"before calling. Separately, the OpenMV 3 JPEG buffer was reduced from 64 KB "
"to 23000 bytes, so large frames may now raise out-of-memory — lower the JPEG"
" quality or framesize."
msgstr ""
"``image.compress()`` / ``compressed()``\\ 는 이제 ``quality``\\ 가 1–100 범위를 "
"벗어나면 조용히 클램프하는 대신 오류를 발생시킵니다. 호출하기 전에 ``quality``\\ 를 1–100으로 클램프하세요. 별도로, "
"OpenMV 3 JPEG 버퍼가 64 KB에서 23000 바이트로 줄어들었으므로, 큰 프레임은 이제 메모리 부족을 일으킬 수 있습니다 —"
" JPEG 품질이나 프레임 크기를 낮추세요."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:193
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `9efd7474a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/9efd7474a>`__, `9a7c3defc "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/9a7c3defc>`__"
msgstr ""
"*커밋:* `9efd7474a <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/9efd7474a>`__, "
"`9a7c3defc <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/9a7c3defc>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:199
msgid "``lens_corr()`` zoom is now functional *(behavior)*"
msgstr "``lens_corr()`` 줌이 이제 작동함 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:201
msgid ""
"``image.lens_corr()`` now actually applies its ``zoom`` argument (it was "
"previously parsed but ineffective), so output differs for scripts that "
"passed a non-default zoom. Re-check ``lens_corr()`` tuning."
msgstr ""
"``image.lens_corr()``\\ 가 이제 실제로 ``zoom`` 인자를 적용합니다(이전에는 파싱되었지만 효과가 없었음). "
"따라서 기본값이 아닌 줌을 전달한 스크립트는 출력이 달라집니다. ``lens_corr()`` 튜닝을 다시 확인하세요."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:205
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `d6b49adef <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/d6b49adef>`__"
msgstr ""
"*커밋:* `d6b49adef <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/d6b49adef>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:210
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "마이그레이션 체크리스트"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:212
msgid "For a clean port to v2.1.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "v2.1.0으로 깔끔하게 포팅하려면 일반적으로 다음 작업이 필요합니다:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:214
msgid ""
"Replace ``image.FREAK`` with ``image.ORB``, drop the descriptor-type "
"argument, and update ``match_descriptor()`` tuple unpacking / "
"``draw_keypoints()`` to the keypoints object (:ref:`the ORB rework "
"<v2_1_0_orb>`)."
msgstr ""
"``image.FREAK``\\ 를 ``image.ORB``\\ 로 교체하고, 디스크립터 타입 인자를 제거하며, "
"``match_descriptor()`` 튜플 언패킹 / ``draw_keypoints()``\\ 를 키포인트 객체에 맞게 갱신하세요 "
"(:ref:`ORB 재작업 <v2_1_0_orb>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:218
msgid ""
"Rename ``sensor.set_whitebal()`` / ``set_gain_ctrl()`` / "
"``set_exposure_ctrl()`` to the ``set_auto_*`` forms (:ref:`the auto-function"
" rename <v2_1_0_autofuncs>`)."
msgstr ""
"``sensor.set_whitebal()`` / ``set_gain_ctrl()`` / ``set_exposure_ctrl()``\\ "
"을 ``set_auto_*`` 형태로 이름 변경하세요 (:ref:`자동 함수 이름 변경 <v2_1_0_autofuncs>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:221
msgid ""
"Move histogram/statistics code to the object methods (:ref:`the "
"histogram/statistics rework <v2_1_0_histogram>`)."
msgstr "히스토그램/통계 코드를 객체 메서드로 옮기세요 (:ref:`히스토그램/통계 재작업 <v2_1_0_histogram>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:223
msgid ""
"Rename ``find_features()`` ``scale=`` to ``scale_factor=`` (:ref:`the "
"find_features rename <v2_1_0_findfeatures>`)."
msgstr ""
"``find_features()``\\ 의 ``scale=``\\ 을 ``scale_factor=``\\ 로 이름 변경하세요 "
"(:ref:`find_features 이름 변경 <v2_1_0_findfeatures>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:225
msgid ""
"Use blob-object accessors and replace ``find_markers()`` with "
"``find_blobs(merge=True, ...)`` (:ref:`the find_blobs change "
"<v2_1_0_findblobs>`); replace ``img.copy_to_fb()`` with the ``copy_to_fb=`` "
"keyword (:ref:`the copy_to_fb change <v2_1_0_copytofb>`)."
msgstr ""
"블롭 객체 접근자를 사용하고 ``find_markers()``\\ 를 ``find_blobs(merge=True, ...)``\\ 로 "
"교체하세요 (:ref:`find_blobs 변경 <v2_1_0_findblobs>`); ``img.copy_to_fb()``\\ 를 "
"``copy_to_fb=`` 키워드로 교체하세요 (:ref:`copy_to_fb 변경 <v2_1_0_copytofb>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:230
msgid ""
"Clamp ``compress()`` quality to 1–100 and re-check JPEG sizes on the OpenMV "
"3 (:ref:`the compress change <v2_1_0_compress>`); re-tune ``lens_corr()`` "
"zoom (:ref:`the lens_corr change <v2_1_0_lenscorr>`)."
msgstr ""
"``compress()`` 품질을 1–100으로 클램프하고 OpenMV 3에서 JPEG 크기를 다시 확인하세요 "
"(:ref:`compress 변경 <v2_1_0_compress>`); ``lens_corr()`` 줌을 재조정하세요 "
"(:ref:`lens_corr 변경 <v2_1_0_lenscorr>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:234
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "그 외 모든 스크립트는 변경 없이 실행됩니다."
